        | 0x04010000    | 0x0401FFFF  | BOOTRAM address space 64 KB The actual size is 10 KB.                                                          | &#10060;        |
        | 0x04020000    | 0x0FFFFFFF  | Reserved 192 MB                                                                                                | &#10060;        |
